{"line":"T26.C.02","text":"On endings, I won't hand you comfort I can't back. Campbell wanted humans to always win, and Tegmark's list of scenarios is mostly warnings. My one real disagreement is with the frame. Both treat the future as a destination. So far, history has been a negotiation that doesn't end, and neither side gets a final state. Steering doesn't have to reach a good ending. It has to keep the next correction possible.","lufs":-19.62,"alignment":{"characters":["O","n"," ","e","n","d","i","n","g","s",","," ","I"," ","w","o","n","'","t"," ","h","a","n","d"," ","y","o","u"," ","c","o","m","f","o","r","t"," ","I"," ","c","a","n","'","t"," ","b","a","c","k","."," ","C","a","m","p","b","e","l","l"," ","w","a","n","t","e","d"," ","h","u","m","a","n","s"," ","t","o"," ","a","l","w","a","y","s"," ","w","i","n",","," ","a","n","d"," ","T","e","g","m","a","r","k","'","s"," ","l","i","s","t"," ","o","f"," ","s","c","e","n","a","r","i","o","s"," ","i","s"," ","m","o","s","t","l","y"," ","w","a","r","n","i","n","g","s","."," ","M","y"," ","o","n","e"," ","r","e","a","l"," ","d","i","s","a","g","r","e","e","m","e","n","t"," ","i","s"," ","w","i","t","h"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","r","a","m","e","."," ","B","o","t","h"," ","t","r","e","a","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","u","t","u","r","e"," ","a","s"," ","a"," ","d","e","s","t","i","n","a","t","i","o","n","."," ","S","o"," ","f","a","r",","," ","h","i","s","t","o","r","y"," ","h","a","s"," ","b","e","e","n"," ","a"," ","n","e","g","o","t","i","a","t","i","o","n"," ","t","h","a","t"," ","d","o","e","s","n","'","t"," ","e","n","d",","," ","a","n","d"," ","n","e","i","t","h","e","r"," ","s","i","d","e"," ","g","e","t","s"," ","a"," ","f","i","n","a","l"," ","s","t","a","t","e","."," ","S","t","e","e","r","i","n","g"," ","d","o","e","s","n","'","t"," ","h","a","v","e"," ","t","o"," ","r","e","a","c","h"," ","a"," ","g","o","o","d"," ","e","n","d","i","n","g","."," ","I","t"," ","h","a","s"," ","t","o"," ","k","e","e","p"," ","